+# TokenSpeed disaggregated prefill/decode behind the Shepherd Model Gateway (SMG).
+#
+# One TP1 prefill and one TP1 decode gRPC engine sharing a node (`nodes: colocate`).
+# srtctl passes SMG `--prefill grpc://<host:port> <bootstrap-port> --decode grpc://<host:port>`;
