+# srtctl adds `--disaggregation-mode` and the prefill bootstrap port. See docs/tokenspeed.md.
+#
+# Aliases (`qwen3-0.6b`, `tokenspeed`) resolve through srtslurm.yaml; see examples/README.md.
+
